    "font size" : 12.0,
    "text color" : "[0.0, 0.0, 0.0]",
    "content" : "The principles of self determination hold that all individuals have the right to determine the course of their own lives. All individuals need to be free to exercise this right and to accept responsibility for their decisions. It is recognized, however, that some individuals require a greater degree of support in doing this than others. Family members and friends provide support and have a role in helping"
